§ `Tests: s 210`

#ASSERT `s 210(1) this section has effect for determining the other relevant transactions or arrangements` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 210(1) this section has effect for determining the other relevant transactions or arrangements` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

