#ASSERT `s 210(2) the other transaction or arrangement is a relevant transaction or arrangement` TRUE (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 210(2) the other transaction or arrangement is a relevant transaction or arrangement` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

