`s 213 test: director` MEANS `s 213(4)(a) a director of the company or of its holding company with whom the company entered into the transaction or arrangement`
`s 213 test: connected person` MEANS `s 213(4)(b) a person with whom the company entered into the transaction or arrangement who is connected with a director of the company or of its holding company`
`s 213 test: the connected person's director` MEANS `s 213(4)(c) the director of the company or of its holding company with whom any such person is connected`
`s 213 test: authorising director` MEANS `s 213(4)(d) any other director of the company who authorised the transaction or arrangement`

-- s 213(4): the persons liable (a) to (d); sections 197, 198, 201 and 203 are named in (a) and (b); section 200 is not (fork F-213-1)
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: director` `s 213 section 197` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: director` `s 213 section 203` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: connected person` `s 213 section 201` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: the connected person's director` `s 213 section 198` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: authorising director` `s 213 section 200` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: director` `s 213 section 200` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213 test: connected person` `s 213 section 200` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 213(4) the person is one of the persons liable` `s 213(4) none of these` `s 213 section 197` EQUALS NOTHING

